Lenovo Thinkpad L13 with touch-Display

-

After starting an already existing project I noticed, that I can't interact with the GUI with Touch "Clicks". Nothing had any effect, except the "Minimize, Close..."-Window Buttons. On a run from the terminal this worked. After a lot of analyses, I figured out, that Touch is not working if the Environment Variable "GDK_CORE_DEVICE_EVENTS" is set to any value. So I configured Eclipse to NOT set this variable. (I don't think this is related to the problem, but I am not 100% sure)

