I have already analysed all MOUSE/TOUCH-Events with this result: There are never any Touch-Events registered, all MOUSE_EVENTS are not synthesized (synth=false) and the "Touch-Click" on the Menu-Item works with normal "MOUSE_PRESSED, -RELEASED, -CLICKED" Events. And when I try to click on a submenu only "MOUSE_EXITED" and one "MOUSE_MOVED" events happen.

